## Services (lib/services/)

### [api_service.dart](mdc:lib/services/api_service.dart)

All HTTP calls go through `ApiService._makeRequest()`. Never create a second HTTP client.

**Archive-specific methods:**
- `getArchiveStats()` → `GET /api/lawsuits/stats/`
- `archiveLawsuit(id)` → `POST /api/lawsuits/{id}/archive/`
- `unarchiveLawsuit(id)` → `POST /api/lawsuits/{id}/unarchive/`

**Hearing CRUD** (new):
- `createHearing(data)` / `updateHearing(id, data)` / `deleteHearing(id)`

**Judgment CRUD** (new):
- `createJudgment(data)` / `updateJudgment(id, data)` / `deleteJudgment(id)`

**Case Timeline** (new):
- `getCaseTimeline(lawsuitId)` → `GET /api/lawsuits/{id}/timeline/`

**AI Analysis** (new):
- `analyzeCaseWithAI(lawsuitId)` → `POST /api/lawsuits/{id}/analyze/`

**Advanced search** (new):
- `searchByPartyName(name)` — passes `party_name` query param
- `searchByCourtLevel(level)` — passes `court_level` query param

### [ai_api_service.dart](mdc:lib/services/ai_api_service.dart)

Handles direct AI chat (`/api/ai/chat/`) and RAG document management. Do not duplicate its token handling.

