## Configuration (lib/config/)

### [api_config.dart](mdc:lib/config/api_config.dart)

**All endpoint constants live here.** New Django endpoints must be added as constants first.

New endpoint helpers (functions, not constants):
```dart
ApiConfig.caseTimelineEndpoint(lawsuitId)  // /api/lawsuits/{id}/timeline/
ApiConfig.caseAnalyzeEndpoint(lawsuitId)   // /api/lawsuits/{id}/analyze/
```

