## Providers (lib/providers/)

### [lawsuit_provider.dart](mdc:lib/providers/lawsuit_provider.dart)

Single provider for all case archive state. Extended with:

**New filters:** `courtLevelFilter`, `lawyerFilter`, `filingDateFrom/To`

**New sub-data loaders:**
- `loadHearings(lawsuitId)` / `createHearing` / `updateHearing` / `deleteHearing`
- `loadJudgments(lawsuitId)` / `createJudgment` / `updateJudgment` / `deleteJudgment`
- `loadCaseTimeline(lawsuitId)` — populates `timeline` list
- `analyzeCaseWithAI(lawsuitId)` — triggers RAG analysis, refreshes `selectedLawsuit`

